BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.090 0.196 0.302 rg 1 0 0 1 56.00 689.08 Tm (support the employee directory, employee forms, profile tabs, organization chart, organization setup,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.090 0.196 0.302 rg 1 0 0 1 56.00 676.48 Tm (assets, document expiry, and audit log. Consistent controls reduce the effort required to learn each) Tj ET
