BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.090 0.196 0.302 rg 1 0 0 1 56.00 405.28 Tm (scanning or a comprehensive security certification. Audit records and employee timelines also require) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 0.090 0.196 0.302 rg 1 0 0 1 56.00 392.68 Tm (access controls because their content can reveal personnel changes.) Tj ET
